# Nothing is required. The playground and its scripted UHP server run with zero secrets and
# zero external network calls, locally and on Vercel.
#
# The PLAN's optional "live text" mode (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY) is intentionally not wired in this
# build: the cancel and GET /v1/responses/{id} paths rebuild responses deterministically from
# the response id, and model-written text would break that. See README "Optional live text".
#
# Never add HarnessRouter, OpenAI, OpenRouter or other provider keys for this app.
